{
 "encounter_id": "00937",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning, Mr Deshpande. Terrible weather, and I hear the car park is full again. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning, doctor. Yes, I circled three times. Thankfully the weather doesn't affect itching. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Itching, that's what we're here about. Tell me everything. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I have prepared a timeline. The itching is worse at night, and it began late last month, or perhaps early this month. I cannot be exact."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's fine. Where do you itch?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mainly between the fingers, and on my wrists. There's a rash, small red bumps in lines."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any scratch marks?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, many. My wife says I look like I fought a cat."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And in the family? Is anyone else itching? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My wife and my daughter, yes. Since last week. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swollen glands?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No swollen glands."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pus, anything oozing from the spots?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No pus."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Rash on the face?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, not on the face."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you started any new soaps or washing powder?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No new soaps, I checked with my wife."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, shall I weigh him? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not yet, nurse, I'll call you. What have you been using?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cetirizine, 10 mg, at night. Calamine lotion, twice a day. And a cream from the pharmacist, a white tube, I cannot recall the name, I'm sorry."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We'll find it. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Possibly. In hospital I think something gave me a rash, a sticking plaster or maybe a medicine, I am not sure which."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll note a possible, unconfirmed allergy. Other health problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Eczema, since childhood, and mild asthma."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Appendicectomy, in 2008."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Illnesses in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother has diabetes. My father has high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Chartered accountant."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And at home?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I live with my wife, two children and my mother-in-law. We all share the sofa."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Smoking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "None."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Pulse 74, blood pressure 124 over 80, temperature 36.7, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14, weight 76 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Normal? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All normal. Let me see your hands.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Here. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There are small red bumps and thin, wavy lines between your fingers and across your wrists, with scratch marks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Those are the burrows? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Possibly. And the skin on your waist has scratch marks too, but no infection."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your breathing today?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, my chest is fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This could be scabies, given the night itching and the whole household itching, but I can't rule out a flare of your eczema."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Scabies. Oh dear. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's very common, nothing to do with cleanliness. I'd like to arrange a skin scraping, and I'd like to look at the lines with a dermatoscope."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I can get the scraping kit now. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please. And I'd like to do blood tests to check for a skin infection."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will the others need checking too? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, the whole household, once we know. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll tell them. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the itching continues two weeks after treatment, come back and see me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
